sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Monitor as Insights Zendesk Monitor
    participant Fred
    participant API as Insights API
    participant Zendesk

    Operator->>Monitor: Confirm Fred or reply switch change
    Monitor->>API: Persist global supervision control
    API-->>Monitor: Current state, actor, and timestamp

    loop Queue 15 seconds; selected thread 5 seconds
        Monitor->>API: Read open queue, drafts, and selected ticket
        API->>Zendesk: Read ticket and Conversation Log
        Zendesk-->>API: Live user, agent, and bot messages
        API-->>Monitor: Queue and thread
    end

    opt Operator prepares the open-ticket queue
        Operator->>Monitor: Confirm Prepare open drafts
        loop Each ticket without a pending draft
            Monitor->>API: Read current ticket and Conversation Log
            API->>Zendesk: Fetch current conversation evidence
            Zendesk-->>API: Ticket and thread
            API-->>Monitor: Current status, authors, and messages
            alt Requester is waiting and a public reply is safe
                Monitor->>Fred: Observation-only draft request
                Fred-->>Monitor: Reply body only
                Monitor->>API: Save shared pending draft
            else Pending, staff-last, internal-only, or escalation-only
                Monitor-->>Operator: Skip with reason
            end
        end
        Monitor-->>Operator: Saved, skipped, and failed totals; nothing sent
    end

    Operator->>Monitor: Request Fred draft
    Monitor->>API: Check Fred drafting control
    Monitor->>Fred: Observation-only request plus current Conversation Log
    Fred-->>Monitor: Draft text only
    Monitor->>API: Save shared pending draft
    API-->>Monitor: Draft ID and audit metadata
    Operator->>Monitor: Edit, replace, or clear draft
    Operator->>API: Save edited draft for approval
    alt Email, web form, or other Support ticket
        Operator->>Monitor: Approve exact saved draft
        Monitor->>API: Send with confirmed draft ID
        API->>API: Reject stale draft; enforce reply control
        API->>Zendesk: Add public ticket reply
        Zendesk-->>Monitor: Updated conversation
    else Messaging ticket on Suite Growth
        Operator->>Monitor: Copy draft and open Zendesk
        Monitor-->>Operator: Draft copied; nothing sent yet
        Operator->>Zendesk: Review and send in Messaging composer
        Zendesk-->>Monitor: Conversation Log shows sent message
    end

    alt Operator escalates
        Operator->>Monitor: Choose teammate and optional private note
        Operator->>Monitor: Confirm exact handoff
        Monitor->>API: Submit confirmed escalation
        API->>Zendesk: Reassign ticket and add internal note
        Zendesk-->>Monitor: Updated owner and conversation
    end
